          "kicker": "Form guide",
          "heading": "Fiji suffer home Pacific Nations Cup knockout defeat against Japan",
          "body": "Fiji lost 20-15 to Japan at home in the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage in September 2026. That result leaves the national side with four defeats in their last five matches. Within that same five-game run, the team secured just one victory. In the current tournament, they sit 12th of 12 teams on the log. The side has suffered three losses in their three tournament fixtures. They have scored 49 points so far. Additionally, the team has conceded 145 points over the same period."
