      "edition": "Thursday 1 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Future secured",
          "heading": "England flanker Tom Curry signs new Sale Sharks contract extension",
          "body": "England flanker Tom Curry has committed his long-term future to Sale Sharks, signing a contract extension to remain at the club until at least 2028. The 28-year-old, who has won 71 caps for his country, progressed through Sale's academy and has made over 125 appearances since his 2016 debut. Curry's extension follows his receipt of an enhanced England Elite Player Squad contract in August. Expressing his delight, Curry said: \"Sale Sharks means everything to me.\""
        },
